<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">1Bituru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sẽkoo Au Gaa Shɛnɛ a Bituru Naa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Bituru</para>
  <para style="toc3">1P</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sẽkoo au gaa shɛnɛ a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bituru</para>
  <para style="imt1">Yuu tasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Sẽkoo au gaa shɛnɛ a Bituru naa. Shɛsipɛ a shɔ gɨnnɛyi nii, shɔgbete shɔɓayi nɛ &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete Ɗalapa lɔyiyɛ,&gt;&gt; Shɔgbeteyi i si ɓa bang ɓa siyi sãtitɛttɔyɛ a kaa naa kɨn ni kpai a tipi Asiya. Vigbete sɨnrɛ shɔ beeriyi sẽkoom ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔu masi shɔ vi ɓalinɛyi bi, shɔgbeteyi ɓoora a yɔnɛni ai tete sisɨn ãnɛ. Shɔvi beenɛm beevim nɛn kpari shɔvi ɓalinɛyi sisɨn ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn a Yesɔ Kirisi yuu, shɔgbete u vɔnɛ au yunɛni geliyinɛ i pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛn yɛ sɔ atɔ. Aruumkɔ, i ma sisɨn kn ai tete raɓoonɛni, i kpa kaka a tete ntanɛ gbete shɔ ntayi sisɨn ãnɛyɛ, nɛi yɛ kpa vi ɗɔnwanɛtɔ a &lt;&lt;Lee gbete Yesɔ Kirisi kɛ tasiu yuunɛ yɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="ip">Au bi manɛ gbete masiyiyɛ ai ɗaa yuu kɔnɛni, shɔ labeenɛu kasi u shɔ vi ɓalinɛwi nɛ i ɔ̃ jo naa shɔgbete i pɛ Kirisi ɓɛyɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Viyuu tasinɛ (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Gɨn kpanɛ a Ɗalapa ruu shɔ raanɛ (1.3-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔu ɔ̃ Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ (1.13-2.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Vigbete a shɔ gɨnnɛ iyɛ pɛli a ɗaa yukɔnɛyɛ (2.11-4.19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yuu roorinɛ a vishonɛ (5.1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyayisinɛ (5.12-14)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Nkɔng Bituru sẽkoom shɛ ang nakɔ, Yesɔ Kirisi jashonɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Yɛnɛ shɔgbete Ɗalapa lɔyiyɛ bi, shɔgbeteyi ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ shɔzati, ai sãti gbete gbete a tipi Pontu yɛ, a tipi Galantiya, a tipi Kafadokiya, a tipi Asiya, a tipi Bitiniya ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Aru Ɗalapa Da zɛwɔ tɛttɔ a lɔwɔrɛ a risɔɔ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ au kaa Ɗa Suru, ɔ gɨn Yesɔ Kirisi nya, u kpaa u sɔwɔɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Mɛnɛ Tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni u ɔ̃ ɔ ɓɛɛkɔ piti.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sisɨn Pɔ̃nɛ pɛ̃niba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />U dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa Da a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi tɔ! aru u raantanɛ pɛ̃niba ãu suru sɔɔtɛ a nyaba au yusi Yesɔ Kirisi a saa yɛ. Vim pɔ̃ntɛ u ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ pɛ̃niba ɗɔn, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />U ɗɔ nokɨn nɛ Ɗalapa tasiu shɔbiiyi susãritɛ, pɔ̃sɔɔ tɛttɔ a kolapa, aɗɔgbete yɛ pũ ɓayɛ, ko lɛsi ɓa, yɛ nteɓa. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Ɗa susãrim pɛ ɔ ɓɛɛkɔ, a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗalapa kaka kɔwɔɔtɛ, ɔ naranɛ yɛ ɔ̃ dangdang, shɔyɛ tasɔɔ a leeu koo yisinyayɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ɔ nta tɔ̃vɨntɔ ayuu vimni, dɔdɔrim tɔ̃tɔ ɔ sisɨn u lɛsitɔ sekaa aru zɔng sisɨn ntanɛ gbete ɔ ɓooraa au yuuniyɛ waanɛm. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Sisɨn ntanɛm a raaɓoonɛni u tasinɛ ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ pɛ nizɛ. Ko tarimɛɛ, a shɔ lɛsi dɔɔtɔ yɛ shɔ nta pɛ a yaa; ji ɗɔkɔ awɔ sisɨn ãnɛni, au kɔrirɛ tɛɛ tarimɛɛtɔ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔu ntautɔ nɔgbete ɔ mɛɛsisɨnyɛ. kɛɗɔn ɔ yɛ kpaa bɛlinɛtɔ a bassinɛ a shɔbassinɛni a ɗagbete Yesɔ Kirisi yɛ shɛshiyuyɛni. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ɔ ɔri Yesɔ Kirisitɛ ama ɔ ji zɛu ɓa shãani ɓa, ɔ ɓa ɗɔgbete ɔ zɛuyɛ dɔddɔrimni ɓa, ama ɔ ãsisɨntɛ au biini, ɔ nta sisɨn purutɛ pɛ̃niba tɛɛ kakatɛ, au nya sha ɗɔɓayɛ, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />aru ɔ tɛɛ pɛ ɔ suruyi raanɛ, ukɔ sɨnrɛ ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ au bi.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Jo ayuu raanɛnkɔ, janyagadiyi kãtɔ tɔ̃vɨn, i mɛɛsẽsẽ, i shatɔ aru tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔyɛni. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />I kã nyaba nɛi zɛ ɗagbete ɗau yɛ pɛliyɛ, a nogbete yɛ ayɛni. N si jo ɗagbete Kirisi Suru tasi ai sisɨn yɛ, sha nogbete Kirisi yɛ ɓooraayɛ au bassinɛ au yɛ gɨu kɨntiyɛni. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Ɗalapa tasi janyagadiyitɔ nɛ vishonɛ shomi ɓanɛi aru i kpaari i yuu viwɔ ɓa, ama ɓɛɛjo awɔ yuukɔ, nagbete i nwanya aru vigbete ɔ ntaɓa dɔdɔrim a jashonɛyi nyayɛ, shɔgbete i gelɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn aka Ɗa Suru kaka gbete shɛ a kolapayɛ. Vimiyi pɛ vigbete ko Ɗajashonɛlapa ma i yɛ kasi zɛnɛtɔ.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Ɓawɔ Nya Ɔ Ɔ̃ Ɔ̃nɛ Tɔ̃vɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Ɔ mabiitɔ a sisɨn aru vishonɛ, ɔ ɔ̃ nɔkãkãri ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn kpai ayuu Ɗa susãri gbete shɔyɛ ãwɔyɛ a leegbete Yesɔ Kirisi yɛ tasiu yuu yɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ɔ gɨn Ɗalapa nyatɔ, ɔkɔɔ yawɔ yuunɛ ɔ vikasinɛ ɔ pɛlisiyɛ, u ɗakɔɔrɛ ɔ pɛlirɛ toti nagbete siwɔ nɔɔ ji ɓeli ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ama ɔ ɔ̃ jo Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a vigbete ɔ pɛliyɛni piti, Ji nagbete Ɗalapau ɓaunyayɛ u wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Labeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ aru n pɛ Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Ɔ ɓaunɛ Da, a ɗagbete ɔkɛ gaki Ɗalapa nɛyɛ, shɔgbete au yeeri shɔ ruu zali kpai, ji nogbete kopiya pɛli viyɛ; ɔkɛ ɔ̃nɛ a kotipim ɔ ɔ̃ au seti ntanɛni. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Aruviya ɔ zɛ viu shɔ shoyɛtɛ a shɔ rawɔ a ɔ̃nɛ gbete ɔ ɓɛuruyi i ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ vilansi kɔ̃linɛ gbete i yasɔɔ a kɨntiyɛ. Siɓa vigbete lɛsiyɛ ɓa, naa tarimɛɛ ko tari gbete au saa yuu pararayɛ ɓa; <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Ama sipɛ Kirisi kpaa gbete au nteyɛ, naa jamerẽẽ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ u vɔrɔ siɓa biini. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Ɗalapa lɔurɛ si ji pɛli kotipi ɓa, a tasiu a leegbete koo yisinya ɓam, jo awɔ yuukɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Au kabiikɔ ɔ ã sisɨnrɛ a Ɗalapa biini, shɔgbete yusiu a saa a bassinɛ rɛ, aru nankɔ ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ ɔ̃ a Ɗa biini.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Dɔdɔrim nogbete ɔ sɔɔkɔɔ yuutɛm ɔ gɨn ruu tɔ̃vɨntɛ, ɔ ɗɔ zɔ ɔrinɛ a sisɨn gbete, ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ a sisɨn gbete. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />aka suru Ɗanyaruubii shɔ yeewɔ sɔ̃ntɛtɔ. U nyaruubii ɔ̃ dangdang, shɔ ji yeewɔ ɓa naa zɔvi au vɔtɔ ɓa sɔ̃n ɓa zɔvi gbete yɛ vɔyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Nogbete laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Jashɔzɛyi piti kpai naa wisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">i bassinɛ kpai pɛ naa kowa a jaalaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Wisi waatitɔ, kowa ma ɗɔɔtɔ,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ama Uɓeyelapa nyaruubii ɔ̃ dangdang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Ruum pɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete shɔ nwarɔɔyɛ.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tari Suru a Shɔ Ɗalapa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Aru nankɔ ɔ zɔ̃wɔ yuu kati a vini pɛlinɛni; nyayeenɛ tɔɓa, ko shɔɗakinɛ tɔɓa ko gɨnkaanɛ ko nyakoo dãnɛ tɔɓa. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ɔ ɔ̃ naa jabẽrẽti sɔɔ a shɔ yeeu dɔɔtɔyɛ, au kã mii e suru zalak kopiɗaviya, nogbete ɔkɛ ɓoonɛ ɔ barɛ ɔ ranaarɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Nɔgbete laabeenɛ Ɗanyarubii shayɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɛ nɔgbete Uɓeyelapa u tɔ̃vɨn ɔ̃ yɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Ɔ a Uɓeyelapa ɗɔbiitɔ, tari suru gbete jashɔzɛyi bẽu a nɔniyɛ, ama Ɗalapa lɔurɛ u ɔ̃ kiriri. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Ɔ a jo naa tari suru, a Ɗalapa shovi awuni u ɗɔɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa suru manɛyɛ. Ɗɔgbete ɔ yɛ shɔvi a ɗɔn naa shɔlansi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi, ɔ ã viyuu ãnɛ a Ɗalapa tɛyɛ aka Yesɔ Kirisi. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Aruukɔ laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;N lɔɔ tari kiriri au vishonɛ tɛɛ gãsiyi kpai a dɔjaa tanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">gbete n ɗɔ pɔ̃nɛ a ɗɔɔ wanɛ a Siyona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">shɔgbeteu kɛ ã sisɨnnɛ au biini yɛ ntayusẽ ɓa.<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Ɔ shɔgbete ɔ ã sisɨntɛ tarim pɛ tɔ̃vɨn awɔ ɗɔbiini; ama shɔgbete i ji ã sisɨn ɓami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;&lt;Tari gbete shɔɗɔmaanɛ i bɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ nɛu vishonɛ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ukɔ ɔ̃ tɛ tari gbete au tɛɛ tari gãsiyi kpai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii wɔɔ sha sɔ̃nnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;Shom pɛ tari gbete yɛ pɔ̃ shɔ dɔkɔnɛ kɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">tari gbete yɛ pɔ̃yirɛ i wẽsiyɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">I kɔdɔɔ aru i ji ã sisɨn ɓa a ruumni ɓa; shɔm pɛ Ɗalapa pɔ̃yirɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ama ɔkɔɔ nyakoo gbete Ɗalapa lɔɔyɛ, ɔkɔɔ kpati shɔlansiyi, ɔ tipi Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, Ɗalapa shɔbiiyii, shɔ lɔɔurɛ nɛu waanya aru vinɔlusinɛ pɛ̃niba e Ɗalapa, shɔgbete ɓaunya a ɗɔkɨnri yɛnɛ u vinɔlusinɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Si a ɗauni ɔ siɓa Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi ɓa, ama dɔdɔrim ɔ pɛ u shɔbiiyi; a ɗauni si ɔ ji zɛ Ɗalapa raatãnɛ ɓa, ama dɔdɔrim ɔ tɛu raatãnɛtɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Fooyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Masayi n gakɔɔtɔ, ɔ naa shɔzati ɔ wɛrɛ ɓa a kotipimni ɓa! Ɔkɔɔ sɨ sisɨn nɛ a vijazɛbii kasinɛ, aruviya i pɛ shɔnɔpɔ̃ a suruni. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ atette shɔgbeteyi gɨn Ɗa ɓayɛ u ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn, naa ikɛ shanɛ nɛ ɔ pɛlinɛ pɛ vini, i yɛ zɛwɔ vi tɔ̃vɨntɔ i bassi Ɗalapa rɛ au leegbete yɛ a yɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Aru Uɓeyelapa u kpaa bassinɛ, ɔ ãwɔ yuutɔ ɔ gɨn shɔgbete i kaka shɔzɛyi yuuni nyatɔ, ɔ gɨn kpati pɛ̃niba nyatɔ, aru u kaka tɛɛ kopiyatɛ, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />ɔ gɨn gɔmnayi nyatɔ, au lɔyi nɛi tasi shɔruuvini raayɛ, u bɛli shɔgbeteyi pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨntɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Aruviya Ɗalapa kasinɛ nɛ ɔ ɓusi shɔgbete i sẽrẽ ɓayɛ i nyashanɛtɔ a vitɔ̃vɨng gbete ɔ pɛliyɛni. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ ɔ̃nɛ yuu, ɔkɔɔ pɛlishovininɛ ɔ ɔ̃nɛ yuuni nɛi kuki vini, ama ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ au tasinɛ ɔ Ɗalapa fooyi. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Ɔ bassi kopiyatɔ, ɔ ɔri shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gãsiyitɔ, ɔ bassi Ɗalapa tɔ, ɔ bassi kpati tɔ.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vitasinɛ e Kirisi Raaɓoonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Jawɛrɛyi ɔ ãwɔ yuutɔ awɔ showɛrɛyi biini ɔ tasiyi basinɛtɔ, ɓanɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a shɔ yuuroorinɛyikɔ shɛli ɓa, ama a shɔgbete i lattɔni kpai. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Naa akɛ mɛɛsisɨnnɛ a ɓooraa aru gbete ɓa ruuvini ɓa, ama a pɛli aru Ɗalapa ruubii, yɛ tasaa susãritɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Naa shɔkɛ waanɛ aru ruuvini a pɛliyɛ akɛ mɛɛsisɨnnɛ a yɛ kpaakɛ iviya? Ama naa akɛ mɛɛsisɨnnɛ aru vigbete a pɛli tɔ̃vɨn, Ɗalapa yɛ tasa susãritɔ a yuuni. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Ɗalapa ɓawɔ nya jo aru ruumkɔ, aru Kirisi au yuu ɓooraatɔ awɔ yuuni, yawɔɔtɛ a vitasinɛ, aru ɔ sɔɔ nyaba gbete au sɔɔyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Ji pɛli ruuvini wɔɓa, shɔwɔ ji nta nyazɔ̃ wɔɔ ɓa au nyani ɓa. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Shɔ dãurɛ ji kɔsi nɔɔ ɓa a dãnɛ ni ɓa. Naa ɓooraatɛ ji tɔɓanɛn kɔsipɛ ɓa, ama pɔ̃ sisɨn a Ɗalapa bi, shɔgbeteu yeeruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Kirisi au yuu tuu ruuvini au bi yɛnɛ laa a shɔ ɓaunaa aɗɔnyɛ, pɛli ɗɔkɔ aru u yaa ruuvini, u ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ, aru nɔrɔ̃ gbete shɔ ntarukɔ u kpaa gatinɛrɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ɔ si naa mɛrẽẽ ai ni nyabayɛ, ama dɔdɔrim shɔ sɔrɔɔtɛ ɔ gɨn jagaviva, au kɔwɔ suruyɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Suwɛrɛyi a Shɔwɛrɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Ji nyabankɔ ɔ suyuwɛrɛyi, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨn a kɔrɔ ɔ ãwɔ yuutɔ awɔ shɔwɛrɛyi biini, nɗa shɔgbete ji ã sisɨn ɓa a Ɗalapa nya ruubiini ɓa, ɔ vishonɛ yɛ gɔ̃itɔ i ã sisɨn rɛ. Ɓanɛ setɛ ɔ sharuuwɔtɛ ɓa, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />naa ikɛ zɛwɔ vi pɛlinɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ nɛ ai zɛwɔ ɔ̃nɛ bassi Ɗalapa tɔ i yɛ kɔsitɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Ɔ kɔrinɛ kɔ ɔ̃nɛ e biɓilinkɔ sheeli ɓa, nagbete ɔ ntori sɔ̃yuuyɛ, ko visho tarimɛɛ ɔ tosiyɛ, ko fãrã gbete ɔ tosiyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nankɔ, ɔ kɔrinɛ u ɔ̃ jo e sisɨn ɓuzɨn, ɓa e gbete yɛ ntɛyɛ ɓa, ɔ kɔrinɛ u pɔ̃wɔrɛ ɔ ɔ̃ ɓa shɔ yukɔnɛ ɓa, ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ yuroorinɛ, ukɔ pɛ vi pɛ̃niba a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Aru si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛɛ̃ sugbete i pɔ̃ sisɨn a Ɗalapa bi i pɛliyi yuu aka ɓɛvɔyi bi. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Saratu usi jo nankɔ a kuti ɓɛvɔ Ibirayi a ɓaunɛ n shɔwɛrɛ. Dɔdɔrim ɔpɛ u jasoroyi naa ɔkɛ pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn nɛ ɔji nta seti viwɔ ɓayɛ.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Shɔwɛrɛyi ɔkɔɔma ɔ ɔ̃ sɔ̃n jo nankɔ a mɛsoyini a tete sisɨn tɔ̃vɨn ni. Ɔ sãyi a kutinɛni aru gbete i kaka ɓa naa ɔ ɓɛɛ ɓa. Ɔ a mɛsoyini ɔ tɛ Suru a Ɗalapa ãwɔyɛ ayini nyazɔ. Ɔ pɛli vimtɔ aru gbete viwɔyɛ pɛshoɓa awɔ Ɗa gakinɛni ɓa.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raa Ɓoonɛ Aru vitɔvɨng Pɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Au yisinɛ, ɔ sisɨn vi pɛlinɛ ntanɛni u ɔ̃ gbete; ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ, ɔ nta zɔ raatɔ, ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ yuu roorinɛ, ɔ ɔri mɛshozɛyitɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Ɔkɔɔ kɔsi vi kɔ̃linɛ a vikɔ̃linɛni ko zɔ dãnɛ a dãnɛ ni; kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔkɔ ɔ shoriyi a vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ. Si jo vigbete Ɗalapa marɛ nɛn ãwɔyɛ a ɗagbete ɓawɔ nyayɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Nagbete Ɗa nyaruubii shayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">shɔgbete kɛ tɔnɛn ntau tɔ̃vɨn ɔ̃nɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">au kasi nɛn zɛ ɗavi tɔ̃vɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨ a kɔrɔɔ u yaa vi kɔ̃linɛ shalinɛtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">u yaa nyzɔ̃tɔ.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Ɔ̃raatɛ kaka jazɨ a kɔrɔɔ ɔ yaa nyaba vi kɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛtɔ ɔ pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨ a kɔrɔɔ u kã sisɨn puru sisɨn gbete. <verse eid="1PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Aru Uɓeyelapa kn nɔɔ jo a shɔ tɔ̃vɨn bikɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">u wesho ai vigbete i gakiyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">ama bẽẽ shɔgbete i pɛli vikɔ̃linɛyɛ.'' <verse eid="1PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Shɔu yɛ lɛsɔɔ piya naa ɔkɛ pɔ̃ sisɨnnɛ a vi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛyɛ? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ama ko naa ɔkɛ ɓoo raanɛ aru vi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛyɛ, ɔ nta tɔ̃vɨntɔ. Ɔkɔɔ nta shɔwɔ setinɛ, ɔkɔɔ yɔri yuunɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ama ɔ ɔ̃ a Kirisi bassinɛni a sisɨn, ɔ basiu naa Uɓeyelapa. Ɔ mabiitɔ ko-pi ɗaviya a nogbete ɔ kasi shɔgbete ikɛ hɨwɔ ruunɛ nya awɔ ruu sisɨn pɔ̃nɛniyɛ, ama ɔ kasiyi nya a yuu roorinɛ ɔ tasiyi ɗɔɔ sisɨn pɔ̃nɛtɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Ama ɔ ɔ̃ a lɛrinɛni tɔ̃vɨn ko shɔkɛ dãwɔnɛ, ɔkɔɔ pɛli vi kɔ̃linɛnɛ u lɛsɔɔrɛ ɓa, aru shɔgbete i nwa nya kɔ̃linɛ awɔ yuu aru vi tɔ̃vɨn yɛ ɔ pɛli naa shɔgbete i gɨn Kirisiyɛ, i nta yusẽtɔ aru vigbete i shayɛni. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Aru viya kɔritɔ shɔu ɓooraa aru vi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛni, naa kɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa vi pɛlinɛyɛ, a nogbete shɔ pɛli vikɔ̃linɛyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Aru Kirisi vɔjo au ruuvinikɔ ɓa gbete dangdang, shɔ tɔ̃vɨn aru shɔ ruuviniyi, aru gbete u n-tɔ Ɗalapa ɗɔɔ bi. Shɔ nyɔu vɔrɔ a shɔ nɔɔ, ama shɔ yusiu lapa a Suru, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />a ɗagbete usi a Suruyɛ yɛrɛ a nwari shɔ a shɔ mayi a surutɔyɛ nya. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Shɔm sipɛ shɔgbete i gɨn Ɗalapa nyaɓayɛyi suru, a Ɗalapa sisɨn mɛnɛni piti kpai a ɗɔgbete au gai yɛ si Nuhu u ɗɔɔ latosi kɔrinɛyɛ. Shɔgbete ai si yeti latosiu isi piti kpai manta a shɔ raiyi a mii naa, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />miiu ukɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ mii batizima gbete au rawɔ dɔdɔrim yɛ.Ɓa shɔgbete shɔ sɔki bi a wuniyɛ ɓa, ama pɛ ruu shɔ ma a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a sisɨn tɔ̃vɨn yɛ. Ukɔɔ rawɔrɛ a kaa Yesɔ Kirisi lapa yuunɛ, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />shɔgbete yɛkolapa u a Ɗalapa nakɨn, u ɗɔɔ kpati roonɛ a Ɗalapa jashonɛ lapayi yuu piti kpai a kaka gbete a kolapani.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Kirisi Gɨnnɛyi Ɔ̃nɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Kirisi ɓooraa si ji tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ awɔ nɔɔ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔkɔɔ ma ɔ lɛritɔ raaɓoonɛm yɛ a sɔ̃njo awɔ yuuni; aruviya shɔu kɛ ɓooraanɛ a shɔ nɔɔ u naa ɓa a ruuvini ɓa. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Yuunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ, ɔ yaa Ɗalapa u gɨn a ɔkɔɔni, ɔ gɨn ɓa vigbete jashɔzɛ i kasiyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ɔ wari yuu sitɛ knti bang ayuu vigbete shɔgbete i bassi Ɗalapa ɓa i kasi pɛlinɛyɛ. Ɔ ɔ̃nɛ pɛ ɔ̃nɛ vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ, vi gbɔgbɔ, saa ɓoonɛ au yɛ sɨwɔɔ wirinɛyɛ, roorinɛ zɔni a ɗɔgbete shɔ ɓolimii ɗɔnyɛ, a bɛlinɛ vizara a shɔ pɛli vigbete i suru ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ama shɔgbete i bassi Ɗalapa ɓayɛ, dɔdɔrim ɔ̃riyikɛtɛ vibiizaanɛ aru ɔ ji ɓasiyuu ɓa ayini ayi nyaba vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ niɓa, i yɛ dãwɔ kɛtɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ama i yɛ sha vigbete i pɛliyɛtɔ piti a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, shɔgbete au mabii tɛttɔ u ɗɔɔ ganɛ aru u yeeri shɔgbete i a suruni a shɔgbete vɔtɛttɔyɛ ruu. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Si jo a ruukɔ shɔ nwari shɔgbete i votɛtɔyɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn sɔ̃n kɛkɨn jo, aru ko shɔ yeeruu ai yuu a jazɛbii na shɔ yeeri zɔ gãsiyiyɛ; shɔ nwari ruumkɔ aru i ɔ̃ nagbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ a suru.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔtɔ̃vɨng Ai Kɔ Ɗalapa Sẽrẽ Au Ãyiyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Vi piti kpai u nyayisinɛ atɛ Maani. Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨn akɔrɔ ɔ sãwɔ yuutɔ, ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ bimanɛ, nogbete ɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ yɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Ayuu vi piti kpai, ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ sisɨn gbete, aruviya ɔrinɛkɔ sɔ̃ɔ̃ ruuvinirɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Ɔ tɛ zɔ naatɔ awɔ wɛrɛyini, ɔkɔɔ nwanya kɔ̃linɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1PE 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Ɗalapa ã Kopiya sẽrẽ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ tɛttɔ totto, aru u pɔ̃si zɔ naa a wuni, u pɛlishonɛ jo awuni sisɨn gbete. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Shɔgbete kɛ nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn nɛ, u nwa jo naa Ɗalapa shayɛ; shɔu kɛ ɔ̃nɛ shovishonɛ, u pɛli jo a sisɨn gbete a Ɗalapa ãuyɛ, a vi piti kpai Ɗalapa yɛ kpaa bɛlinɛtɔ aka Yesɔ Kirisi bi, bassinɛ a kaka pɛu ɓɛɛkɔ dangdang. Nankɔ.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raaɓoonɛ Aru Ɔ̃nɛ Kirisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />N shɔ ɔrinɛ, masayi, ukɔ ɔ̃rɔɔnɛ vibiizanɛ aru bintanɛ ɔkɛ ntanɛm, bintanɛ ɔkɛ ntanɛm shɔ nta pɛ ɔ sisɨn, ɔkɔɔ tuunɛ naa visɔɔwɔɔ kpaawɔrɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ama ɔ nta yɛti purutɔ aru ɔ ɓooraa gbete Kirisi ɓooyɛkɔ, nogbete ɔ sisɨn puru yɛ ɔ̃ fɛ̃ɛm, naa shɔkɛ tasuu bassinɛ nɛyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ɔ nta yɛti purutɔ shɔkɛ dãwɔnɛ, aru ɔ ã sisɨn a Kirisi bi, aru nankɔ vim tasitɛ nɛ Ɗa suru u ɔkɔɔni, u pɛ suru e bassinɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ɔkɛ ɓooraanɛ, ɓanɛ tasinɛ ɔ pɛ shɔ yuvɔ ɓa, ko ɓɔɔ ko ɔ shɔlanɛ ko shɔu tosiyuu a zɔwɔyi ruukɔ̃linɛyi ɓa. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ama ɔkɛ ɓooraanɛ aru ɔ pɛ Kirisa, ɔkɔɔ ntayusẽnɛ, ama ɔ bɛli Ɗalapa tɔ aru shɔ zɛwɔ tɛ a kirisi nii. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ɗaa pɛlitɛ a shɔ gaa ruuyeenɛ yɛ, shɔ gaa ruuyeenɛ pɛ a Ɗalapa shɔbii yuukɔ, naa kɛ gaanɛ a ukɔ, yɛ yisi kɛpikovi a shɔgbete i ji ã sisɨn ɓa a ruu tɔ̃vɨn ni ɓa viya? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Ji nɔgbete laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;Shɔ tɔ̃vɨn i raanɛ raaɓoonɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">yɛ ɔ̃ri shɔgbeteyi bassi Ɗalapa ɓayɛ shɔ ruuviniyi kɛpikoviya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Aruumkɔ, shɔgbete i ɓooraa aru Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ nɛu ɔ̃ ɗɔkɔ, ai vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn i ãyuutɔ a Ɗalapa bi kpai, ukɔ shɛshirɛ, shɔu kɛ maruunɛ tɛɛ ɓa wezeni ɓa.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Jaaviva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Nkɔng shɔpẽni, n ang yuu n gaki shɔpẽni wɛrɛ Ɗa gbete i awɔ teteyɛ, nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ shɔshinɛkɨnti au zɛ kirisi raaɓoonɛ yɛ, n yɛn kpaa bassinɛ tɔ a leegbete yɛ ayɛni. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Ɔ ɔ̃ naa jagavivayi, ɔ ga jaaviva a Ɗalapa ãwɔyɛtɔ awɔ kasinɛ nɔgbete Ɗalapa kasinɛ ɔ pɛliyɛ, ɓa naa shɔ ntosɔɔtɔ ɓa, ɔ shovishonɛ ɓanɛ aru nazã ɓa ama a sisɨn vishonɛ gaanɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Shɔgbete Ɗalapa ãwɔ nɛ ɔ sãyɛ ɔkɔɔ tasiyi kakanɛ, ɔ ɔ̃ shɔgbete ɔ shɔ gɨnnɛ i mativi awɔ biiyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Naa kpati jagaviva kaanɛyɛ ɔ yɛ tɛ Salabu bassinɛ gbete u ɗɔkɔlinɛ yɛ sɔ̃nyaɓayɛtɔ.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Sɔ̃n ji nankɔ, ɔ jakasayi ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ ãyuutɔ awɔ shɔpẽni biini. Ɔ kpai ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ pɛli zɔ vi ɔ rooriyuutɔ, ɔ shoshi zɔvitɔ; aru laabeenɛ shatɛttɔ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɗalapa bɛ̃ɛ yubassinɛtɔ, ama tasi shɔyuuroonɛ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛtɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ɔ rooriyuutɔ, a Ɗalapa nosisɨn shɔgbete vi tɛu kaka ɓayɛ naa, nɔgbete yɛ ɗeuwɔ kɛkn rakaka a ɗau kasiyɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Ɔ tuu ɔ yuyɔrinɛ piti ɔ ãu a naa, aruviya ukɔ kɔwɔrɛ.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Ɔ ɔ̃ nokãkãri, ɔ kɨnlinɔɔtɔ! Ɔ shɔ nɔpɔ̃, shɔruuvini u ɗɔ witinɛ naa zingan witiyɛ, u ɗɔu kã shɔu yɛ shayɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ɔ shi dɔkaziti awɔ sisɨn ãnɛni, ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gãsiyi kpai a kotipi i ji ɗɔ raaɓoonɛ nankɔ. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ama a knti gbete ɔ ɓooraatɛ sekaa, Ɗalapa e tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ au ɓawɔnya nɛ ɔ kpaa bassinɛ gbete sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi, u au yuu yɛ pɔ̃wɔrɛ ɔ shidɔkaziti tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ, pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ a kakani a bimanɛni. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Kaka kpati roonɛ u ɔ̃kɔɔ u ɓɛɛkɔ dangdangǃ nankɔ.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ Au kunayɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />N beerɔɔ sẽkoo dokaam Sila pɔ̃sinnaa rɛ, shɔu n zɛ naa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Kirisa tɔ̃vɨn. n beerɔɔ jaa sẽkoom n kasirɛ n masɔɔbii, n gelɔɔtɔ shomkɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ. Ɔ shidɔkaziti a yuuni.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Babila, a Ɗalapa lɔyi sɔnjo naa ɔkɔɔ i gee ɔ nyatɛ, wɔsɔ̃n majaa Marikusini gee wɔ nyatɛjo. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Ɔ gee zɔ nya ɔ kɔ̃ti zɔ naa bii naa ɔrinɛ kirisa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Mɛnɛ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni kpai ɔ shɔ gbete ɔ pɛ Kirisi ɓɛɛ yɛ.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>